### Circuit breaker and fallback (unit 5.4)
### Gateway: http://localhost:8080. Passwords come from .env.

@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Login as demo user
# @name userLogin
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo-user",
  "password": "<DEMO_USER_PASSWORD from .env>"
}

@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Healthy: 200
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 3. Stop the catalog first: docker compose stop catalog
### Then send this several times. Expected: 503 application/problem+json,
### title "Service Unavailable", instance "/fallback", requestId set.
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 4. Recovery: docker compose start catalog, wait for it to be healthy.
### After the wait-duration (10s by default) this returns 200 again.
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
